      "Everything in the steel-string's \"Limits of v0\" applies: no note-off damping, one touch point per cell, 24 modes per body, a linear model. A fictional design: every changed number is a design hypothesis in its *.design.json.",
      "No snare wires, no noise source: the field drum's roll is tom-like. No second head on the bass drum. The kettle's air is a ratio table, not a cavity.",
      "The touch pulse is at most 0.36 ms, much shorter than a felt mallet's contact: strikes are brighter than real timpani.",
      "Frets move only the kettledrums (their pedal); the bass and field drums are fixed geometry."
